@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Planner" as Planner
participant ":System" as System

activate Planner

    Planner -> System : ask to select all wagons of a given type, gauge and operator
    activate System

        System --> Planner : shows all wagons of given type, gauge and operator
    deactivate System

@enduml